t,\nindirect, or incidental damages arising from your use of the photobooth, including but not\nlimited to technical failures, loss of data, or dissatisfaction with generated content.\n13. Third-Party Services\nThis photobooth uses third-party AI and cloud services to process and store your content. By\nusing this service, you acknowledge that your content may be processed by these third-party\nproviders in accordance with their respective privacy policies.\n14. Changes to Terms\nWe reserve the right to update these Terms and Conditions at any time. Continued use of\nthe service after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.\n15. Governing Law\nThese Terms and Conditions are governed by the laws of Bangladesh. Any disputes arising\nshall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Bangladesh.\n16. Contact\nFor any questions, concerns, or requests regarding your data or these terms, please contact\nthe event organizer at [contact email / phone].\nBy checking the box below and proceeding, you confirm that you have read,\nunderstood, and agree to these Terms and Conditions, and you consent to the\ncollection and use of your information as described above."